FoodScreen ("Comida" / "Food", More > Body): today's kcal and macros next
to today's burned calories (resolved like the Today card), Photo and
Gallery buttons, today's meals with thumbnails (tap to edit, delete with
confirmation) and previous days grouped by day.

One sheet walks prepare (photo + optional note) -> analysing (progress,
cancel) -> review, where every item, portion and macro is editable, items
can be added or removed, and Save writes the entry and its day totals.
Swipe-dismiss is blocked while a paid analysis runs or awaits review.
A missing or rejected key points to the Coach settings.

Camera via TakePicture into the existing FileProvider (new cache path
food/); the manifest declares no CAMERA permission, but a runtime request
is made if it ever does. Gallery via PickVisualMedia (no permission).

Hooks: AppRoot gets the Destination entry, the More-group entry and the
route (3 lines); file_paths.xml one cache path. Strings live only in the
fork's strings_victor_food.xml (English + Spanish).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
